 d in Berlin\, Fitz has become a familiar face across Europe’s comedy scen
 e\, performing everywhere from small clubs to theaters. His mix of Kiwi and
  German gives a unique perspective rarely seen.\n\\n\nYou might recognise h
 im from his stand-up clips online (with millions of views 👀)\, where he 
